// A tiny ALU. The operation code selects add, subtract, multiply, or the minimum of two
// operands, chosen by a match. Every arm is evaluated, as everywhere in the language, so
// the minimum's comparison is always computed. This is the whole toolkit at work: match,
// the ordering library, and the comparison under it. Run: zkolang alu.zkl
include "order.zkl";

public op;
public a;
public b;
reveal match op {
    0 => a + b,
    1 => a - b,
    2 => a * b,
    _ => min(a, b),
};
